  dialogueText: '"Interestingly, the same Ilokano pronoun ''isuna'' can refer to
    ''she'' as well.

    The meaning depends on the person you''re talking about
    and the context.

    Listen carefully: isuna.

    Now, try saying ''isuna''
    yourself."

'
